/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (Parts A through J are built up as ONE cohesive Express project \(express-lab\) rather than disconnected snippets, since later parts explicitly extend earlier ones \(Part F moves the Part C student route into a Router; Part H adds error handling to the Part G CRUD routes; Part J's Library Management API explicitly "combines everything from this lab"\). Each code section below is labeled with the Part it answers. Because it's all one running server, the terminal tests at the end of each Part reflect the FINAL server \(e.g. once Part J's fake-auth middleware is added, all /api/* calls shown from Part F onward include the required x-auth- token header\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
